        "   CREVETTE / CREVETTES → crevette\n"
        "   AVOCAT / AVOCATS → avocat\n"
        "   PATES / SPAGHETTI / FUSILLI / MACARONI / PENNE / TAGLIATELLE → pates_cuites\n"
        "   RIZ / RIZ LONG / RIZ BASMATI → riz_cuit\n"
        "   GRENAILLE / PDT GRENAILLE → grenailles\n"
        "   PAIN / BAGUETTE / PAIN MOUL / PAIN DE MIE → pain\n"
        "   CAMEMBERT / CAMEMB → camembert\n"
        "   BRIE → brie\n"
        "   CHEVRE / BUCHE CHEVRE / CHEVRE FRAIS → fromage_chevre\n"
        "   MOZZA / MOZZARELLA → mozzarella\n"
        "   COMTE / COMTÉ → comte\n"
        "   EMMENTAL → emmental\n"
        "   SKYR → skyr\n"
        "   BANANE / BANANES → banane\n"
        "   FRAISES / FRAISE → fraises\n"
        "   TOMATE / TOMATES → tomate\n"
        "   EPINARD / EPINARDS → epinards\n"
        "   CHOCO NOIR / CHOCOLAT 70 / CHOC 70% → chocolat_noir\n\n"
        "3. Quantités :\n"
        "   'X,XXX kg' → qty_g = arrondi(X × 1000), qty_count = null\n"
        "   'N × prix' à l'unité → qty_count = N, qty_g = N × poids_unitaire\n"
        "   Poids unitaires : avocat=160, banane=120, oeuf=60, citron=100, filet_mignon_porc=400, saucisse_porc=100\n"
        "   Prix fixe sans quantité → estimer : poulet=600, porc=400, boeuf=400, saucisse=400, pain=400, camembert=250, brie=250, filet_mignon=400\n\n"
        "RÉPONDS UNIQUEMENT en JSON valide, sans markdown, sans texte avant ou après.\n"
        'Format : [{"food_name":"nom lisible","food_id":"id","qty_g":500,"qty_count":null,"category":"proteine","detail":"description courte"}]\n'
        f"food_id parmi : {known_ids}\n"
        "food_id inconnu → food_id:\"autre\" (sera filtré côté serveur)"
    )
    payload = json.dumps({
        "model": "claude-haiku-4-5-20251001",
        "max_tokens": 1500,
        "messages": [{"role": "user", "content": [
            {"type": "image", "source": {
                "type": "base64", "media_type": media_type, "data": image_b64}},
            {"type": "text", "text": prompt_text}
        ]}]
    }).encode()
    req = ur.Request(
        "https://api.anthropic.com/v1/messages", data=payload,
        headers={"Content-Type": "application/json",
                 "x-api-key": api_key,
                 "anthropic-version": "2023-06-01"})
    try:
        with ur.urlopen(req, timeout=30) as resp:
